1
00:00:00,820 --> 00:00:02,880
Good evening, excellence…

2
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,160
We all know this company:

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,450
It started small

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,660
and the Hajj decides everything

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:09,960
The company grew…

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,760
100 employees and 3 branches

7
00:00:12,940 --> 00:00:14,190
and the Hajj still

8
00:00:14,190 --> 00:00:15,440
signs every chlorine order!

9
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,750
The result?

10
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:18,240
Decisions get delayed

11
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:20,430
Nobody knows who's responsible

12
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:22,040
And if the Hajj travels…

13
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:23,530
work stops.

14
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:25,110
This is where we need governance

15
00:00:25,110 --> 00:00:26,350
Governance

16
00:00:26,470 --> 00:00:27,370
Simply put:

17
00:00:27,370 --> 00:00:28,440
Who decides?

18
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:29,430
How?

19
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:30,900
And who holds whom accountable?

20
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:33,660
The international standard ISO 37000

21
00:00:33,660 --> 00:00:35,260
defines it as the system

22
00:00:35,260 --> 00:00:36,680
that directs the organization,

23
00:00:36,680 --> 00:00:37,710
oversees it,

24
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:39,470
and holds it accountable.

25
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,050
Remember it this way:

26
00:00:41,220 --> 00:00:42,820
Governance isn't restrictions…

27
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,360
governance is clarity.

28
00:00:44,700 --> 00:00:45,750
What about you? At your work…

29
00:00:45,790 --> 00:00:47,170
is it clear who owns the decision?

30
00:00:47,290 --> 00:00:48,780
Tell me in the comments
